The Raelion Empire, called Raelion, was a nation on the northern border of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]], founded in the Evergreen Delta by Harrier Rael, the last of Aurelia's companions. Its people followed [[Divinity/Outer Gods/The Compelled|The Compelled]] rather than the [[Iridescent Host|Host]], and its industry and technology stood among the best on Færrin.

[[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]] declared war on Raelion on the claim that Raelion had killed its prime minister, and the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]] blessed the war as a holy one. The fighting ran for twenty years.

Raelion ended on the Night of the Midnight Sun. Operatives of the Calarian [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]] carried the [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]] into a fane in the city of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/Orilon/index|Orilon]] and planted it on the [[Phenomena/Ley Line|ley line]] beneath. The blast ran the length of the weave through the country, leaving a broad crater in the earth where Raelion had been. Little of Raelion remains today.
